@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/v1

### Orden MARKET por cantidad de acciones (CA1: BUY 10 PAMP -> FILLED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 10
}

### Orden MARKET por monto en pesos (CA5: BUY por 50000 ARS en PAMP -> FILLED, size 54)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "amount": 50000
}

### Orden LIMIT con precio límite (CA3: BUY 5 PAMP a 900 -> NEW)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "size": 5,
  "price": 900
}

### Orden rechazada por fondos insuficientes (CA10: 201 Created con status REJECTED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 814
}

### Error de validación: MARKET con price no permitido (CA20: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 10,
  "price": 900
}

### Cancelar una orden en estado NEW creada previamente (CA1: 200 OK con status CANCELLED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/14/cancel
Accept: application/json

### Cancelación repetida sobre una orden ya cancelada (CA2: 409 Conflict ORDER_NOT_CANCELLABLE)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/14/cancel
Accept: application/json

### Cancelar una orden inexistente (CA6: 404 Not Found ORDER_NOT_FOUND)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/99999/cancel
Accept: application/json
